#: apps/shipping/models.py
msgid ""
"In the rate calculation, shipping is free when the goods in the package are worth at least this "
"amount, without VAT. Leave it empty for no free shipping."
msgstr ""
"Dans le calcul des tarifs, l'expédition est gratuite lorsque les marchandises du colis valent au "
"moins ce montant, hors TVA. Laissez vide pour ne pas proposer d'expédition gratuite."

#: apps/manager/forms.py
msgid "In the store"
msgstr "En magasin"

