#: themes/ride/templates/accounts/mfa/verify.html
msgid "This browser does not support passkeys."
msgstr "Ce navigateur ne prend pas en charge les clés d'accès."

#: apps/orders/amendments.py
msgid ""
"This change moves the delivery address, so it needs a fresh passkey confirmation for this "
"amendment (an open passkey window does not cover it; a confirmation given before the draft was "
"edited no longer counts)."
msgstr ""
"Cette modification déplace l'adresse de livraison et nécessite donc une nouvelle confirmation par "
"passkey pour cette modification (une fenêtre passkey ouverte ne la couvre pas ; une confirmation "
"donnée avant la modification du brouillon ne compte plus)."

#: apps/manager/templates/manager/amendment_passkey.html
msgid ""
"This change of order %(number)s is %(what)s: confirm it with your passkey. The confirmation is for"
" this change only, once."
msgstr ""
"Cette modification de la commande %(number)s est %(what)s : confirmez-la avec votre clé d’accès. "
"La confirmation ne vaut que pour cette modification, une seule fois."

#: apps/orders/amendments.py
msgid ""
"This change refunds money to the customer, so it needs a fresh passkey confirmation for this "
"amendment (an open passkey window does not cover it; a confirmation given before the draft was "
"edited no longer counts)."
msgstr ""
"Cette modification rembourse de l'argent au client et nécessite donc une nouvelle confirmation par"
" passkey pour cette modification (une fenêtre passkey ouverte ne la couvre pas ; une confirmation "
"donnée avant la modification du brouillon ne compte plus)."

#: apps/compliance/templates/email/compliance/withdrawal_acknowledgement/body.html
#: apps/compliance/templates/email/compliance/withdrawal_acknowledgement/body.txt
msgid ""
"This confirms that on %(submitted_at)s you declared, with the withdrawal function of our website, "
"that you withdraw from the contract for the following parts of order %(order_number)s:"
msgstr ""
"Nous confirmons que le %(submitted_at)s tu as déclaré, avec la fonction de rétractation de notre "
"site, exercer ton droit de rétractation pour les parties suivantes de la commande %(order_number)s"
" :"

#: apps/accounts/views.py
