#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/package_cancelled/body.html
#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/package_cancelled/body.txt
msgctxt "(L)"
msgid "We apologise for the inconvenience."
msgstr "Nous te prions de bien vouloir nous excuser pour ce désagrément."

#: apps/orders/messages.py
msgid "We are not taking new orders right now. Nothing was charged. Please try again later."
msgstr ""
"Nous n'acceptons pas de nouvelles commandes pour le moment. Rien n'a été débité. Veuillez "
"réessayer plus tard."

#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/package_cancelled/body.html
#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/package_cancelled/body.txt
msgctxt "(L)"
msgid ""
"We are sorry to tell you that the seller %(vendor_name)s cannot fulfil your order "
"%(order_number)s. Your order with %(vendor_name)s has been cancelled and we have immediately "
"refunded the full %(refund)s EUR to the payment method you used for the purchase."
msgstr ""
"Nous t’informons que le vendeur %(vendor_name)s ne peut pas honorer ta commande %(order_number)s. "
"Ta commande auprès de %(vendor_name)s a été annulée et nous avons procédé immédiatement au "
"remboursement intégral de EUR %(refund)s sur le moyen de paiement utilisé lors de l’achat."

#: apps/orders/ui/present.py
msgid "We cannot calculate the VAT for this vendor's items to your address. Contact the vendor."
msgstr ""
"Nous ne pouvons pas calculer la TVA des articles de ce vendeur pour ton adresse. Contacte le "
"vendeur."

#: apps/manager/amendment_forms.py
msgid ""
"We cannot fulfil it, for example the goods are unavailable: the refund fee is charged to the shop"
msgstr ""
"Nous ne pouvons pas l’honorer, par exemple la marchandise est indisponible : les frais de "
"remboursement sont facturés à la boutique"

#: themes/base/templates/500.html
msgid "We could not complete your request. Please try again in a few minutes."
msgstr "Nous n'avons pas pu traiter ta demande. Réessaie dans quelques minutes."

#: apps/orders/ui/views.py
msgid "We could not confirm your VAT number with VIES now, so VAT is charged on your order."
msgstr ""
"Nous n'avons pas pu confirmer ton numéro de TVA auprès de VIES pour le moment, la TVA est donc "
"appliquée à ta commande."

#: apps/compliance/views.py
msgid "We could not find an order with this number and email address."
msgstr "Nous n'avons trouvé aucune commande avec ce numéro et cette adresse e-mail."

#: apps/orders/ui/views.py
msgid "We could not find this product."
msgstr "Nous n'avons pas trouvé ce produit."

#: apps/orders/ui/views.py
msgid "We could not open your cart."
msgstr "Nous n'avons pas pu ouvrir ton panier."

#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/item_unavailable/body.html
#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/item_unavailable/body.txt
msgctxt "(L)"
msgid ""
"We have already refunded %(refund)s EUR (VAT and any shipping share included) to the payment "
"method you used."
msgstr ""
"Nous avons d’ores et déjà procédé au remboursement automatique de EUR %(refund)s (TVA et quote-"
"part éventuelle des frais de livraison incluses) sur ton moyen de paiement initial."

#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/amendment_applied/body.html
#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/amendment_applied/body.txt
msgid "We have refunded %(refund)s EUR to the payment method you used."
msgstr "Nous t’avons remboursé %(refund)s EUR sur le moyen de paiement que tu as utilisé."

#: apps/compliance/templates/compliance/includes/model_withdrawal_information.html
msgid ""
"We may withhold reimbursement until we have received the goods back or you have supplied evidence "
"of having sent back the goods, whichever is the earliest."
msgstr ""
"Nous pouvons différer le remboursement jusqu'à ce que nous ayons reçu les biens ou jusqu'à ce que "
"vous ayez fourni une preuve d'expédition des biens, la date retenue étant celle du premier de ces "
"faits."

#: apps/catalog/templates/catalog/includes/product_returns.html
msgid "We pay the return shipping"
msgstr "Nous prenons en charge les frais de retour"

#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/order_received/subject.txt
msgid "We received your order %(order_number)s"
msgstr "Nous avons bien reçu ta commande %(order_number)s"

#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/order_received/body.html
#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/order_received/body.txt
msgid ""
"We received your order %(order_number)s (total %(total)s EUR). We will confirm it when the payment"
" is complete."
msgstr ""
"Nous avons bien reçu ta commande %(order_number)s (total : %(total)s EUR). Nous te la confirmerons"
" dès que le paiement sera terminé."

#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/payment_confirmed/body.html
#: apps/orders/templates/email/orders/payment_confirmed/body.txt
msgid ""
"We received your payment of %(total)s EUR for order %(order_number)s. Each seller will prepare its"
" part and you will get a message when it ships."
msgstr ""
"Nous avons bien reçu ton paiement de %(total)s EUR pour la commande %(order_number)s. Chaque "
"vendeur prépare sa part de la commande et tu recevras un message dès qu’elle sera expédiée."

#: apps/compliance/templates/email/compliance/notice_received/subject.txt
msgid "We received your report"
msgstr "Nous avons reçu votre notification"

#: apps/compliance/templates/email/compliance/notice_received/body.html
#: apps/compliance/templates/email/compliance/notice_received/body.txt
msgid "We received your report and will review it."
msgstr "Nous avons reçu votre notification et nous l'examinerons."

#: apps/compliance/templates/compliance/withdrawal_done.html
msgid "We received your withdrawal from order %(number)s on %(at)s."
msgstr "Nous avons reçu ta rétractation de la commande %(number)s le %(at)s."

#: apps/compliance/templates/email/compliance/statement_of_reasons/body.html
#: apps/compliance/templates/email/compliance/statement_of_reasons/body.txt
msgid "We restricted your content or account. This is the statement of reasons."
msgstr "Nous avons restreint votre contenu ou votre compte. Voici l'exposé des motifs."

#: apps/compliance/templates/email/compliance/notice_decision/body.html
#: apps/compliance/templates/email/compliance/notice_decision/body.txt
msgid "We reviewed your report and reached a decision."
msgstr "Nous avons examiné votre notification et pris une décision."

#: apps/themes/styleguide.py
msgid "We send the order confirmation here."
msgstr "Nous envoyons ici la confirmation de commande."

#: apps/orders/ui/forms.py
msgid ""
"We send the order confirmation to this address. Required: without it we cannot confirm your order."
msgstr ""
"Nous envoyons la confirmation de commande à cette adresse. Obligatoire : sans elle, nous ne "
"pouvons pas confirmer votre commande."

#: apps/compliance/templates/compliance/withdrawal_done.html
msgid "We sent the same confirmation to the email address of the order. Keep it as proof."
msgstr ""
"Nous avons envoyé la même confirmation à l'adresse e-mail de la commande. Conserve-la comme "
"preuve."

#: apps/orders/templates/orders/_legal_boxes.html themes/ride/templates/orders/_legal_boxes.html
msgid "we use your data to carry out this order. Read the notice to know more."
msgstr ""
"nous utilisons tes données pour exécuter cette commande. Lis la politique de confidentialité pour "
"en savoir plus."

#: apps/orders/templates/orders/checkout.html themes/ride/templates/orders/checkout.html
msgid ""
"We use your details only to deliver your order and to issue the invoices of the vendors you buy "
"from."
msgstr ""
"Nous utilisons tes informations uniquement pour livrer ta commande et pour émettre les factures "
"des vendeurs auprès desquels tu achètes."

#: apps/vendors/templates/vendors/apply/form.html
msgid ""
"We use your name and email only to handle this application and, if you are accepted, your seller "
"account. An application nobody confirms is deleted after a few days."
msgstr ""
"Nous utilisons votre nom et votre adresse e-mail uniquement pour traiter cette candidature et, si "
"elle est acceptée, votre compte vendeur. Une candidature que personne ne confirme est supprimée "
"après quelques jours."

#: apps/compliance/templates/email/compliance/termination_notice/body.html
#: apps/compliance/templates/email/compliance/termination_notice/body.txt
msgid ""
"We will end the service of %(vendor_name)s on the platform. This email is the notice of "
"termination and the statement of reasons."
msgstr ""
"Nous mettrons fin au service de %(vendor_name)s sur la plateforme. Cet e-mail constitue la "
"notification de résiliation et l'exposé des motifs."

#: apps/compliance/templates/email/compliance/termination_withdrawn/body.html
#: apps/compliance/templates/email/compliance/termination_withdrawn/body.txt
msgid "We withdrew the notice of termination of %(vendor_name)s. Your service goes on."
msgstr "Nous avons retiré la résiliation de %(vendor_name)s. Votre service continue."

